    "code": "\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectVisible? THEN\n\t\t\tDO ApproachObject\n\tELSE\n\t\t\tIF IsObjectNear? THEN\n\t\t\tDO PickingObject\n\tELSE\n\t\tSEQUENCE\n\t\t\t\tIF IsObjectHeavy? THEN\n\t\t\t\tDO CallForHelp\n\t\tEND\n\t\tDO DoTask\n\tEND\n"
